Ideas

The runway mod was written for this repo. It follows the idea of
token-weather-usage by Eric Cologni (https://github.com/augiefra/claude-mods,
Apache-2.0): one band above the prompt with the context, the usage limits
against the clock, the prompt cache, the session cost and the running agents.
No code was copied from it.

Repo tooling from copilot-plugin-cc

The development tooling below comes from copilot-plugin-cc by tmathura
(https://github.com/tmathura/copilot-plugin-cc), Apache-2.0, and is not part
of the mod. It was changed to name this repo and the mod, and the rules for
ports from an upstream repo were left out:

- scripts/bump-version.mjs, tests/bump-version.test.mjs and tests/helpers.mjs,
  which that repo ported from codex-plugin-cc
  (https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc), Copyright 2026 OpenAI, licensed
  under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Each file says in a comment at the
  top that it was changed.
- .claude/skills/workflow-* and .claude/skills/spec-review-page
- tests/collect-rejected.test.mjs, tests/poll-reviews.test.mjs and
  tests/spec-review-page.test.mjs
- .github/workflows/pull-request-ci.yml, .github/dependabot.yml and
  .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml
- docs/development.md and docs/conventions.md

